{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3525160/extras/6d2ea4e869f08fc2f7d19188722d0dfc.avif?t=1772022482\" width=800 height=81 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Black Horizon: Armada</strong> is a digital deck-building strategy game set in an original sci-fi universe. There is no pre-game deck building\u2014strategy emerges entirely during battle. Every decision matters, forcing you to adapt, improvise, and outthink your opponent in real time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3525160/extras/66635f9bebfc7b9f3c1e1c5e00f0e268.poster.avif?t=1772022482\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3525160/extras/66635f9bebfc7b9f3c1e1c5e00f0e268.webm?t=1772022482\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3525160/extras/66635f9bebfc7b9f3c1e1c5e00f0e268.mp4?t=1772022482\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3525160/extras/346eb39b6bfd3c8dc776ccb95c137bf3.avif?t=1772022482\" width=800 height=81 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each match takes place across <strong>three randomly selected planets</strong>, each acting as a strategic lane. Planets have <strong>unique effects</strong> and offer <strong>exclusive cards</strong> that can only be acquired while fighting there, forcing players to rethink positioning, timing, and resource management every game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3525160/extras/7ef22d594db9010d940976ed44526e49.poster.avif?t=1772022482\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3525160/extras/7ef22d594db9010d940976ed44526e49.webm?t=1772022482\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3525160/extras/7ef22d594db9010d940976ed44526e49.mp4?t=1772022482\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3525160/extras/df053ec32751179566a72f1b37bdabf5.avif?t=1772022482\" width=800 height=81 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cards are discovered through play. As you encounter new ships, stations, and actions, they are permanently unlocked in your <strong>Gallery</strong>, growing your collection and revealing new synergies and strategies over time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3525160/extras/5d7ff60794af6fa1e4d4ee21a924d3ef.poster.avif?t=1772022482\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3525160/extras/5d7ff60794af6fa1e4d4ee21a924d3ef.webm?t=1772022482\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3525160/extras/5d7ff60794af6fa1e4d4ee21a924d3ef.mp4?t=1772022482\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3525160/extras/f0ceb994a78def0b4e4ee8b4b1345f1c.avif?t=1772022482\" width=800 height=81 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your deck is constructed dynamically during each match, shaped by the planets in play and the cards you choose to pursue. Every decision matters, and no two decks\u2014or matches\u2014are ever the same.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3525160/extras/ebb3e13c62d647668784310aafbe16ab.poster.avif?t=1772022482\" width=1170 height=624 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3525160/extras/ebb3e13c62d647668784310aafbe16ab.webm?t=1772022482\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3525160/extras/ebb3e13c62d647668784310aafbe16ab.mp4?t=1772022482\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3525160/extras/2320cdaf9edfcc6ae0c019fb123b6704.avif?t=1772022482\" width=800 height=81 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Random planet selection, planet-specific rules, exclusive card pools, and dynamic deck building combine to create <strong>trillions of possible matchups</strong>. Planet synergies can dramatically change how the game plays, delivering endless strategic depth and replayability.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3525160/extras/775e0def15935b643832f73d809bc0fa.poster.avif?t=1772022482\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3525160/extras/775e0def15935b643832f73d809bc0fa.webm?t=1772022482\" type=\"vid